      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -10179,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、人口增长率提高对稳态的影响（图20-8）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5ad5793f693a4bd2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -10069,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、现代经济增长理论的特征（图片2）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "71bd6bf2801346bd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -10069,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、选择性保护政策类型及特点**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7afbbc295214d1a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -10069,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、举例说明（数字化示例）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6ddd699e2e04361",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9959,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、理论意义与应用（补充图片3内容）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19021acb6fb4e55",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9959,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、选择性保护下的问题与挑战**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1cf292ac58604c4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9959,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**产业结构迅速升级：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9974765f729a4bb0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9849,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**产量水平：$Q_0$ 与 $Q_1$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "50e6a059786c477d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9849,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长抵消了收入增长**"
    },
    {
      "id": "add27a1cd8e04e8d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9849,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率$n$、技术进步率（此处先假设为零）和折旧率$\\delta$均为外生变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2cb5c4eea9541c8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9739,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率$n$提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5daa63be6d64898",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9739,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率的增加降低了稳态水平的人均资本和人均产出**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7aa57407f2b84ea7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9739,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人均产出迅速增长**"
    },
    {
      "id": "918e69ce3f714663",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**从需求变动看地租如何产生**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e12f65b0ce5f457b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**以牙还牙**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9281ad0240ae4d4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9629,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**价格水平：$P_0$ 与 $P_1$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "90d1af0ba3674798",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**企业对政府保护的依赖与腐败风险:**"
    },
    {
      "id": "060e612d8ee14c40",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**传统农业部门**"
    },
    {
      "id": "737e7b7386884eb7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9519,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**佐证观点的数据与经济学解释**"
    },
    {
      "id": "807a1dae7a904a1a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**供给曲线：呈阶梯状或分段水平的“粮食供给曲线”**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f73474c6a34d43c7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**供给量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "045c774db95b4182",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9409,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**保留**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0c15547374d41e0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**保证增长率$G_W = Vs$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "32e337f8617e401c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**倒U形曲线：人口增长率随人均收入变化的关系**"
    },
    {
      "id": "33c99943ff0e4f5b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9299,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**停战止损**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8aaccb5080b543e0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率$s$提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7302cb60e14943ca",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率增加仅导致稳态产出水平一次性提高，但长期增长率并未改变**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e6750ebd29847e5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9189,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率提升**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cff977b89443484a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率的提高提升了稳态的人均资本水平和人均产出水平**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e0ca9eefe069440d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**僵持期**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0033fe180aa430e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9079,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**允许人民币贬值**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6819bfebb594268",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全球供应链与产业转移效应**"
    },
    {
      "id": "74722b3f409f40a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全球供应链并未与中国真正脱钩**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f49d888f91524b82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8969,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全面保护主义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "971361ead3a54e5a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**六、与拉美ISI策略的比较：选择性保护 vs 全面保护**"
    },
    {
      "id": "02ab61917f9d44b6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**六、经济含义总结**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c494378d03242bc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8859,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**共同对外关税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef6a7f9b89c041f8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**关税与政策调整：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0fa36c93bae48f2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**关税政策演变：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "569cb3815a2f4a6b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8749,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**关税政策调整：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "24c615bda9cf4f0a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**关税降级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "db44c0dc56c241bf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**关键假设：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e57166c0643434b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8639,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**内容**"
    },
    {
      "id": "90735c450be64faf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**内需市场饱和**"
    },
    {
      "id": "31409496398b48c6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**写在章节前面的**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe79b492069c48d2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8529,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**农业部门存在大量剩余劳动力**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a895fb2f10034d17",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**农业部门的劳动投入与产出(或边际产量)关系**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3789f73f87b406d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**农业部门的工资或生存工资**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a644e3f860649a9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8419,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口加工区（EPZ）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5d3e5bc2df5440d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口大幅增长与国际竞争力提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "dab18a0a5b0c4aff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口导向型战略**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c82f2881f68241a8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8309,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口导向转型阶段（1960年代）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4737b81f1ff34deb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口管制**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1d35bc16d3f4729",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**刚投入生产的边际土地**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3ba4e9de0974c27",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8199,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**初始均衡：需求曲线$d_0$与供给曲线交于$(Q_0, P_0)$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f1184d78a4d494d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8089,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**制度、观念与意识形态的调整是技术进步和经济增长实现的重要条件**"
    },
    {
      "id": "298c3735ed0c488e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8089,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**前三最重要**"
    },
    {
      "id": "337d6b0df4e14b32",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8089,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**前两道**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7710e9f198ed4b6c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7979,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**前两道题**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8fe7402448ae4d21",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7979,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**劳动力供给曲线**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f057a6ab4a44b43",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7979,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**区域一体化**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7cfd47b4149a4c6b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7869,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**半导体**"
    },
    {
      "id": "92840f049fa84a9f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7869,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**参考文献：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "62e478d9ebde4d80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7869,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**双边贸易与全球影响：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd2d252e6f724c47",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7759,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**发展与全球化**"
    },
    {
      "id": "08c70ceab182402e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7759,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**发展的途径**"
    },
    {
      "id": "15e834f549cd481d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7759,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**台湾初期产业结构：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "536bfeb81c054ddc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7649,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**同日**"
    },
    {
      "id": "10a20e2a669e43cf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7649,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**同时**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5fceeb704ba4a65",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7649,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**后两道**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9310530c6c814c86",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7539,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**后两道题**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0c6c77502494a86",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7539,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**向上倾斜的红线**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f4297d3c7f44270",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7539,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、图形理解（图片中的图示）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8dbc8377e544206",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7429,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、提高经济弹性和维护出口竞争力的策略分析**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f86aaf16f5454e6e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7429,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、政策效果分析：产业升级与经济腾飞**"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb743092cd2044d3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7429,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国家投资大型项目+引进外资技术+扶植民营升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8347c51b6ec4df5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7319,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国有企业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4597f98a14c4fb5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7319,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国际经济扩张迅速**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf586e6782124b62",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7319,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**图1：美中关税争端间接促成的出口增量（“谁受益？”）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4519dc027fc94872",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7209,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**土地改革**"
    },
    {
      "id": "14304654df85483f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7209,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**在拉美较为缺乏：许多拉美工业由于政治原因被长期保护，即使效率低下仍难以触动，拖累了整体经济。也有学者指出，东亚国家政府**"
    },
    {
      "id": "85336a0c35824020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7209,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**地租来自于土地肥力（或资源禀赋）的差异**"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd60a8c2914a4513",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7099,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**培育—竞争—升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb63836e80814dd7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7099,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**基本假设**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed69be5c5122404a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7099,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**增长与发展**"
    },
    {
      "id": "982eec0b6b9d487e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6989,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大幅提高报复关税和管制战略物资出口**"
    },
    {
      "id": "270fb1aa4a5c479c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6989,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大范围商品清单**"
    },
    {
      "id": "83cb480b96b24655",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6989,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大豆对华出口当年同比暴跌约75%**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe0edfd4c8f74130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6879,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大豆贸易**"
    },
    {
      "id": "719464197d3d4a56",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6879,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**定向信贷**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4b83f7b39a94ffb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6879,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**实现了经济腾飞，被誉为“东亚奇迹”。所谓**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d653519d74894b35",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6769,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**实际新增购买几乎为零**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4c36b56bdca4325",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6769,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**富国与穷国**"
    },
    {
      "id": "586c805b46a94bb5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6769,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对中国商品征收超高关税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "627edc9adc734aaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6659,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对出口企业给予进口投入品免税、退税、出口所得减免税50%等优惠**"
    },
    {
      "id": "620179072f3e4f64",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6659,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对北美及其他贸易伙伴的新关税措施**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ece2955611214b15",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6659,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等关税公式及其变化**"
    },
    {
      "id": "358507281f8e477f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6549,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等同步**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe57a4a985a140e5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6549,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等报复升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f8761cfb1d84c93",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6549,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**局部保护争取时间，全面竞争提升效率**"
    },
    {
      "id": "edebd50910a34d65",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6439,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业增加值占GDP比重**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3eaa4a9f3c244f8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6439,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业工资固定**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7903ed1097040f8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6439,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业部门以略高于农业“生存工资(或传统部门工资)”的水平吸收劳动力**"
    },
    {
      "id": "36b6b307bdd34e8d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6329,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业部门对劳动力的需求**"
    },
    {
      "id": "036e59d697444b27",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6329,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业部门愿意提供的工资**"
    },
    {
      "id": "11facfcd9fc94900",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6329,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业部门的劳动力需求与工资水平**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d551a56f4c334d0f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6219,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业革命后的英国**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4cce40384d194c65",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6219,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**差异化处理**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a861f3547d034337",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6219,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**巴西**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc0ebd19d79c43da",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6109,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**市场价格由边际土地决定**"
    },
    {
      "id": "865e0f8ed68843a0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6109,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**市场反应及经济影响**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bfd2be6762694696",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6109,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**并非不可克服**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bcca7d562ef74135",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5999,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**引言**"
    },
    {
      "id": "edaf71b52ed44b03",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5999,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**引言 (Introduction)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac468c6489ac46df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5999,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**强化市场机制**"
    },
    {
      "id": "27a4665cec744c3a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5889,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**当剩余劳动力被逐渐吸收，工资开始上升**"
    },
    {
      "id": "180ccc82e6304eda",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5889,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**成果对比：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "076556ce52d34f73",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5889,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**所有肥沃土地**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bb7db33d61645b7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5779,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**扩大报复**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2db13b47174c4c18",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5779,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**技术水平**"
