      "id": "1896fca4a3864db3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5559,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**投资与产业影响**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d444880ab8714d44",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5559,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**拉美传统ISI的教训**"
    },
    {
      "id": "adaae6b46fae4123",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5559,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**收入与人口之间的关系**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf51b285b3e749f3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5449,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**政府指导投资与信贷：国家通过五年计划等手段选择战略产业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "222f577d8b184939",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5449,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**政策覆盖范围：拉美国家（如巴西、阿根廷、墨西哥）在中期采用的ISI往往对几乎所有制造业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1106ae39f3d945fc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5449,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**新一轮关税政策的核心数据**"
    },
    {
      "id": "53f2d72ab09b478f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5339,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**方面**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d969d312a7440f9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5339,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**更高层次的选择性保护**"
    },
