      "id": "f2f6817678cb4494",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3799,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济增长的历史分析**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7752ab9306ee46e0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3689,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济学发展历史**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a005f17ec654dd3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3689,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济弹性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e4cf2707f9248b8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3689,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济成熟的标志**"
    },
    {
      "id": "542d8ec836304cd0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3579,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济是封闭的**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0036a280e9924008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3579,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济由单一部门构成**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cda7090f7e8a4881",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3579,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济结构快速变革**"
    },
    {
      "id": "65979fde5e6a4ba1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3469,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济适应与区域合作：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5b124db0a124696",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3469,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**经济高速增长与居民收入提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4519b56b85fc40b1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3469,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**结构性改革**"
    },
    {
      "id": "14c7add473914dac",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3359,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**结果**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0061f9170e164dc7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3359,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**结果：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0645262f15fa49f0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3359,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**结论**"
    },
    {
      "id": "183afad457e243af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3249,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**绩效约束**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f21068288b504748",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3249,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**美国从中国进口占比**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e48adcb612b45fa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3249,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**美国对华出口恢复迟滞**"
    },
    {
      "id": "27e102cbfd064cfc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3139,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**考试划重点**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e80c9bea9aa94803",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3139,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**聚焦高科技和中小企业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a791d3e4db149b3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3139,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**股市大幅波动**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8849f8c167164ac3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3029,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**自发调节**"
    },
    {
      "id": "664855da7d954ec9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3029,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**自工业革命以来出现的一种国家经济持续快速增长的现象。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "03b951675dfd44f6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3029,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**自然增长率$G_N = n$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a20ee7f9c2ed40ea",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2919,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**自然资源**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1cf998bf59314c33",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2919,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**蓝色弧线**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8dcf760baf654a5e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2919,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**补贴与财政激励：两国政府向重点产业提供直接或间接补贴，以降低其成本、提高竞争力。其中出口补贴**"
    },
    {
      "id": "041eea6e36ed4f9a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2809,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**解析人口发展的阶段**"
    },
    {
      "id": "75d9f2c4ad3d46a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2809,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**课后阅读**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f990a73b79b4a6d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2809,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**调整与自由化阶段（1980-1990年代）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ebc4fa2f43b04ba6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2699,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**财政与金融负担：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c62793c12d97466c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2699,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**财阀**"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa2a215a196b4a4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2699,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**贸易战带来的机遇与挑战：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a79f403eb224f32",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2589,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**贸易摩擦与市场压力：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6e67b7576c84aff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2589,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**贸易极限施压**"
    },
    {
      "id": "79b74857ed6448d8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2589,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**贸易转移与出口激增：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4413a726125d4033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**资本密集型和技术密集型产业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c654160ba1594953",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**资源错配与低效风险：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "771632c43b30497a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**起步的进口替代阶段（1950年代）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2de99f95797844ee",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**超100%关税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "58739c252af74980",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**越南**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d22bd51c0144c8a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**越南对美出口**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d03ba3cfa4d4560",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**转移过程的三个阶段**"
    },
    {
      "id": "869f7d1990fb43ce",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**近似无限弹性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "689625694bb54b82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**近六成**"
    },
    {
      "id": "37c36046a3ec4465",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**适时开放**"
    },
    {
      "id": "675e60ef43a74009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**选择性保护+出口纪律**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c9dcabec8ef410d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**选择性保护政策**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b909d5218774dff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -2039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**选择性和阶段性的保护**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9b73fcfdd14480c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -2039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**重化工业化战略（HCI）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ace4c2831c504b99",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -2039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**重化工业推进阶段（1970年代）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "148f63da829d4a64",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**重要的推论与现实局限：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9052d1040e854b3e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**长期效应**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e0d6808e5f9043d9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**长期稳定增长**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a112f069383d4587",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段1：完全剩余劳动力阶段**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6008a8a8428f44b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段1：转移开始**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5a44938c86f401f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段2：剩余劳动力逐渐减少**"
    },
    {
      "id": "13d5395f94804506",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段2：边际产量由0开始上升，但仍有剩余**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5534dd89c16407e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段3：农业部门“剩余”完全吸收，转移不再免费**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1be8b378be347a7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阶段3：剩余被吸收殆尽**"
    },
    {
      "id": "08b8fec95d9c4ada",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**阿根廷**"
    },
    {
      "id": "155fb5c247b3431f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**降低关税、取消出口税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7177c1208c5439c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**降低进口关税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5262755ff1d64634",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**降低部分关税、放宽进口管制**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b9d4ff63bd04c2e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**需求上升：需求曲线从$d_0$移至$d_1$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0d160db29d894db7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**预期目标难以实现**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3319b640d5ed4189",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**首次允许进口阿根廷豆粕（豆粉）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e184eda6730e40b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**马克思**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e4b3f008b9a4a12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**马尔萨斯陷阱的含义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb3306e5306741ff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**马来西亚、泰国**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0bb75aae5da4b00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**高关税与进口管制：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7621bb56d752443f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**高科技**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c96574c62664b88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**高素质人力资本**"
    },
    {
      "id": "030af295c2df457a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（1）人口增长率增加对稳态人均资本和人均产出的影响：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f0d8efaaf644454",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（1）储蓄率提高对稳态人均资本和人均产量的影响：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "980e6ce27156475e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -1049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（1）市场多元化与贸易重组：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a905c3ef11854303",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -1049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（1）经济量扩张**"
    },
    {
      "id": "38b8af8cc0cf49af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -1049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（2）人口增长的经济含义：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "33457d1e83254e96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（2）参与自由贸易协定与降低关税壁垒：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "132de9793df1440d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（2）短期和长期效应（图20-7）：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "97db019a3938485b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（2）经济社会结构变化**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a84f39c5838d4c25",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（3）吸引投资与本地产业升级：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bdb2cd03cdd54f49",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（3）增长的国际贸易**"
    },
    {
      "id": "40f4039a8b554f7f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**（4）财政金融支持与社会保障：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bd9b9c2afa1487a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -719,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**，在引导经济方面“不亚于拉美国家政府的介入深度，但更具有效性” 。因此，选择性保护不是不干预，而是**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae0c066d85da43a9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -719,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**，如韩国90年代几乎完全开放市场 ，台湾取消大部分补贴和管制。这种**"
    },
    {
      "id": "530910b89b354bcb",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 7095,
      "y": -4792,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 930,
      "label": "framework",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "afeaaf3800a54ea1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7135,
      "y": -4752,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
